WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.374
- I think a condiment's job is to make

00:00:02.374 --> 00:00:05.002
everything that you're
eating taste better.

00:00:05.002 --> 00:00:06.972
If it doesn't elevate, then why add it?

00:00:06.972 --> 00:00:10.652
(suave music)

00:00:10.652 --> 00:00:12.577
- Jufran Banana Sauce?

00:00:12.577 --> 00:00:13.698
Why is it red?

00:00:13.698 --> 00:00:14.862
- That makes no sense.

00:00:14.862 --> 00:00:15.741
- Smells like ketchup.

00:00:15.741 --> 00:00:17.210
It smells nothing like bananas.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:18.538
- This label is lying to me.

00:00:18.538 --> 00:00:21.009
- Is this sauce that's made from bananas?

00:00:21.009 --> 00:00:22.733
Or is it sauce for bananas?

00:00:22.733 --> 00:00:23.823
- It says shake well...

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:25.331
- Oh, yeah.

00:00:27.869 --> 00:00:28.645
- Wow.

00:00:28.645 --> 00:00:30.196
- It's a little bit sweeter than ketchup.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.646
- On the way to barbecue sauce,

00:00:31.646 --> 00:00:33.629
but then took a left at banana grove.

00:00:33.629 --> 00:00:35.297
- This would be good on chicken fingers.

00:00:35.297 --> 00:00:36.458
- I feel like if you were drunk

00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:38.172
you wouldn't know that
it wasn't ketchup, maybe.

00:00:38.172 --> 00:00:40.169
- What's there to say? It's good!

00:00:40.169 --> 00:00:41.878
- Harissa Spread.

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:44.324
Ugh.

00:00:44.324 --> 00:00:44.927
Oh.

00:00:44.927 --> 00:00:45.775
- What are you?

00:00:45.775 --> 00:00:47.521
- Uh oh, it smells like it might be spicy.

00:00:49.807 --> 00:00:51.381
- This is really good. It's very tangy.

00:00:51.381 --> 00:00:52.790
- This would be really good on pasta.

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:53.886
- Or a ciabatta.

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:55.942
- I hated it at first bite,

00:00:55.942 --> 00:00:59.946
and now it's dancing in my
pallet, and all I want is more.

00:00:59.946 --> 00:01:02.170
- [Voiceover] Sambal
Terasi Condement Sauce.

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:05.429
- It smells like the spiciest
chili at the chili cook off.

00:01:05.429 --> 00:01:06.776
- There's shrimp in here!

00:01:06.776 --> 00:01:07.743
- Let's see what this is like.

00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:09.763
- Before the spice kicks in,

00:01:09.763 --> 00:01:11.234
I just want to say it tastes pretty good.

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:12.488
- I'm pretty impressed with how much

00:01:12.488 --> 00:01:14.856
of my mouth it's already affected.

00:01:14.856 --> 00:01:16.145
(grunts)

00:01:16.145 --> 00:01:18.380
- I think you could put it on rice,

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:19.726
maybe a nice stir fry.

00:01:19.726 --> 00:01:21.472
- Whenever heat stuff gets to a certain

00:01:21.472 --> 00:01:23.637
heat level it doesn't have flavor anymore.

00:01:23.637 --> 00:01:25.623
- There are two ingredients
in salted shrimp:

00:01:25.623 --> 00:01:28.080
one is shrimp, the other is salt.

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.252
- Look at their little shrimpy eyes.

00:01:30.252 --> 00:01:32.690
- Oh god, it smells exactly
like you'd think it'd smell.

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:34.981
- Confirmation that the little
black spots are their eyes.

00:01:34.981 --> 00:01:36.471
- I don't want to eat this.

00:01:37.949 --> 00:01:38.591
- No.

00:01:38.591 --> 00:01:40.429
- Oh my god, there's so much salt on it.

00:01:40.429 --> 00:01:43.603
- 40% of your daily sodium
is in here 33 times.

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:46.521
- It would be good on
things that need salt.

00:01:46.521 --> 00:01:48.332
- How does this qualify as a condiment?

00:01:48.332 --> 00:01:50.394
- So this is Fermented Bean Curd.

00:01:50.394 --> 00:01:54.028
Bean curd is great, it's tofu, its soy.

00:01:54.028 --> 00:01:55.360
This is disgusting.

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:58.334
- At least this didn't
crawl around at some point.

00:01:58.334 --> 00:01:58.947
(yells)

00:02:00.088 --> 00:02:00.568
- What the?

00:02:00.568 --> 00:02:02.466
(gags)

00:02:03.652 --> 00:02:04.387
- Nope.

00:02:04.387 --> 00:02:07.274
- Smells very sweet, oh god.

00:02:07.274 --> 00:02:08.667
- Look at this thing.

00:02:08.667 --> 00:02:09.387
(groans)

00:02:14.274 --> 00:02:14.855
(laughs)

00:02:14.855 --> 00:02:16.852
- Oh god, that is
literally the worst thing

00:02:16.852 --> 00:02:18.249
I've ever tasted in my life.

00:02:18.249 --> 00:02:22.459
- Coating my mouth in this salty slime.

00:02:22.459 --> 00:02:25.931
- I'm gonna have to date,
get married, have children

00:02:25.931 --> 00:02:27.462
and that taste is gonna be in my mouth.

00:02:27.462 --> 00:02:28.775
- I might be allergic to that.

00:02:28.775 --> 00:02:29.869
- What do you do with this?

00:02:29.869 --> 00:02:34.869
- This would go good on
a viking funeral boat

00:02:34.881 --> 00:02:36.185
that you put out into the ocean

00:02:36.185 --> 00:02:38.086
and then shoot a flaming arrow toward.

00:02:38.086 --> 00:02:39.885
- There are probably
people that love this.

00:02:39.885 --> 00:02:41.696
- Everybody's got a
different tongue, right?

00:02:41.696 --> 00:02:43.205
Cute snack.

00:02:43.205 --> 00:02:44.421
(mutters)

00:02:44.421 --> 00:02:48.147
I'm just a tiny baby
shrimp, I'm covered in salt,

00:02:48.147 --> 00:02:50.217
so if you're hungry, and you're

00:02:50.217 --> 00:02:54.858
tired of being well-hydrated, come at me!

00:02:54.858 --> 00:02:58.306
It's pretty good, though.

